  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需求： <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap\" rel=\"nofollow\">JourneyMap</a></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">以下清單中的任何模组。您不需要此套件的所有模组即可運作。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此套件的目標是為各種模组的生物添加圖標。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">資源套件與所有較低的版本兼容，因此您可以自由添加它。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">我將根據我使用最多的模組嘗試更新這個資源套件。如果您想更新任何模組，請在評論部分中提出。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">希望大家能夠通過捐款支持我。</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fgBP65uzSsM\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://discord.com/api/guilds/889524360992403506/widget.png?style=banner2\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>支持模組</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Mobs</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Nouveau</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elemental\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Elemental</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\">Born in Chaos</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crackers-wither-storm-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cracker's Wither Storm Mod</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderman-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enderman Overhaul</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/good-ending\" rel=\"nofollow\">Good Ending</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hybrid-aquatic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hybrid Aquatic</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hamsters\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hamsters Plus</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/infernal-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\">Infernal Expansion</a></p>\n<p><a href=